      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `c4b63bf7ca25a0c94bf23a51b5e696c36946ae3c1e502d673562e675c543a839--criminal-courts-australia-2010-11-cube-4-source.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Criminal Courts, Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2010-11\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 13 of 13\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | b61aff43e5cc925c03fdb1392d69a28a577448164c4902c888b4b4f4fd58ebf0 | missing |\n| \"Table_1\" | 06d6d1de31a23b79a191bafc7907036d6f4fda837e015413f1ea0b3d0d3484ea | missing |\n| \"Table_2\" | ff1258e7febe64936e3ad1f3e0b75e00d24728933284ebbcf08f4cf8bc5729d5 | missing |\n| \"Table_3\" | fd9867c7de8e23554fc7faf2e9d0b988ce5e4236a0c519321038c7c52554bbeb | missing |\n| \"Table_4\" | 847c172514713543818db3f908a1a78b84d4e357687347e431acae1f02252751 | missing |\n| \"Table_5\" | 628b46482d6567c9228cb3f5190886a9205af04c569ccbed573944a0bb81fe9c | missing |\n| \"Table_6\" | a832a5627a5c21145cb1eb233fdfc78fd0adb28179ba0ce77925881aa3a2f743 | missing |\n| \"Table_7\" | 237876e9b6f2ab903f778f581e412b032168508196f0fe2919a5ffcae0764091 | missing |\n| \"Table_8\" | 9c499cf25fff32da7aba473bc7a1d5798552393c1b32f3c0425629830f653d31 | missing |\n| \"Table_9\" | 2ec96b0a01eaac5a5462d05f46e458a683e2ebf024d67ea871ac1a420468e81e | missing |\n| \"Table_10\" | 0dcd02d5fa1c18dfecf295ebea69e3939cf92c4af562f10844d16d86b323add3 | missing |\n| \"Table_11\" | 8a94369699694febe3790e27877fe3e3a468b5930ef32ed2205d1fa92ea45ba8 | missing |\n| \"Table_12\" | 6ef39bee85b0b7a0a0c35630df484da0731ac9275ad11a2d9ba07ad0034aa755 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictiona